        <mxCell id="human-control" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#64748B;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;WALKTHROUGH NOTE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;margin-top:9px;color:#172B40&quot;&gt;People keep the release gates&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:10px;color:#536579&quot;&gt;Both paths require human review, merge and native AAP production approval. Agents cannot merge or deploy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5F8;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
